01:21:45.900 --> 01:21:46.966
Sama-sama.

01:21:50.366 --> 01:21:51.366
Ya-

01:22:12.733 --> 01:22:14.100
hooo!

01:22:15.400 --> 01:22:17.100
Aku sendirian nih.

01:22:19.233 --> 01:22:25.233
Syuting hari ini, meski baru pertama kali, rasanya seru banget.

01:22:27.200 --> 01:22:28.233
Menyenangkan sekali.

01:22:30.166 --> 01:22:31.166
Imut banget ya.

01:22:35.200 --> 01:22:36.500
Aku nggak tahu tadi ngomong apa saja.

01:22:36.900 --> 01:22:37.633
Seru banget.

01:22:37.733 --> 01:22:38.800
Aku sudah makan siang.

01:22:40.233 --> 01:22:41.233
